                                                "sense_id": "2871d37e-41cc-3640-a5e4-a8b35e6097b7",
                                                "text": "And the visiting side appeared to settle quickly as Wayne Routledge, who had a tough tussle with Stevenage left-back Scott Laird, delivered an early cross that Barton drilled goalwards, forcing a decent save from Chris Day."
